Minor documentation nit (not a fail): CHANGELOG.md's own claim "No visual/behavioral change for
mouse users" is slightly overstated — F7's "Minimum 8 characters." hint text is new visible
content for all users, sighted or not, and its own PR text elsewhere accurately describes the F7
change. Cosmetic-documentation issue only, does not affect finding closure or introduce a defect.

No refutation succeeded against any of the 11 findings or the constitution's blast-radius
concerns. PASS.
